{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國天團BIGBANG昨日於啟德體育園舉行首場演唱會，歌手譚嘉儀與前港姐冠軍黃嘉雯卻因台下行為引發公關災難。她 …</p><p></p>\n<p>韓國天團BIGBANG昨日於啟德體育園舉行首場演唱會，歌手譚嘉儀與前港姐冠軍黃嘉雯卻因台下行為引發公關災難。她們事後分別發文致歉，不過箇中細節被指似乎欠缺誠意，反而進一步點燃全網怒火。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794593602322130_5787861506af75342b2d28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794593602322130_5787861506af75342b2d28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人在漆黑環境中瘋狂開啟閃光燈自拍，甚至錯用官方標記被揭發純屬刷流量。（圖片來源：Threads帖文）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<h2>譚嘉儀黃嘉雯為睇BIGBANG閃燈打卡致歉</h2>\n<p>有現場觀眾發現譚嘉儀與黃嘉雯在漆黑環境中肆無忌憚地開啟閃光燈拍攝多個回合， 及騷擾他人觀賞的行為「斷正」無得否認，於是在有關投訴帖文下面進行道歉，但致歉的方式又惹來網民質疑及恥笑！</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464610463341711_15072504576af820594c999.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_1627.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464610463341711_15072504576af820594c999.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚嘉儀一邊在Threaeds道歉 ，一邊在IG宣傳新歌。（圖片來源：Threads截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>譚嘉儀被奚落欠缺表演機會無常識 </h2>\n<p>結果被奚落，恥笑她不懂得演唱會禮儀係源於欠缺演出經驗： 「 唔緊要，都明你冇咩表現（演）機會，唔會識呢啲野！」</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464610690365041_16172035806af8205b63634.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_1626.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179464610690365041_16172035806af8205b63634.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>IG平台上的䜖嘉儀對公關災難隻字不提（圖片來源：譚嘉儀IG ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>IG唔講當無事、譚嘉儀選擇性道歉惹來奚落 打卡成癮反省欠誠意</h2>\n<p>事件迅速發酵後，譚嘉儀選擇在Threads發文致歉：「當下只係太想記錄低見到偶像時的感受同畫面一時忽略左周圍觀眾嘅感受，係我嘅疏忽。」然而這番言論備受質疑，因為她僅在Threads回應，其Instagram帳戶卻繼續宣傳新歌對事件隻字不提。</p>\n<h2>黃嘉雯致歉之餘強調自己係Fans</h2>\n<p>前港姐黃嘉雯則在道歉帖文中強調自己是樂迷身份：「由佢地宣布開演唱會我已經期待左好耐，所以嗰刻先想同台上既佢地影張相留念，係我地疏忽咗人。」</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17946461088036213_6393251926af8205d435da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IMG_1628.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17946461088036213_6393251926af8205d435da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：黃嘉雯Threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>歌手譚嘉儀與黃嘉雯圈中閨密情厚</h2>\n<p>翻查資料顯示歌手譚嘉儀與2019年香港小姐冠軍黃嘉雯一向感情極好，屬於圈中公認非常要好閨密。兩人私底下經常相約聚會，不但多次結伴出埠旅遊，更不時齊齊做運動保持身形，近年在演藝工作上亦有不少同台合作機會。她們平時在社交平台上極度活躍，習慣將生活點滴及奢華行程鉅細無遺地與粉絲分享。這次兩人結伴同行追星，原本是開心聚會，結果因在台下失控行徑釀成嚴重公關危機。</p>\n<h2>網民揭發標記出錯直指行為極失禮</h2>\n<p>大批網民對於兩位藝人極端自私行為感到極度憤怒，更揭發她們上載照片時連官方帳號都標記錯誤，紛紛湧入各大討論區留言聲討。有自稱坐在附近觀眾激動表示：「完全係打卡Only，真粉絲唔會係ON SHOW自拍打燈影相」。有網民奚落譚嘉儀不懂得演唱會禮儀源於欠缺演出經驗：「唔緊要，都明你冇咩表現機會，唔會識呢啲野」。更有憤怒網民嘲諷她們行徑令人側目：「心諗以為啲大陸網紅，點知原來係香港藝人，好失禮下囉」。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179459360655910403_20669900416af75346d84ba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179459360655910403_20669900416af75346d84ba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>風騷自拍。（圖片來源：Threads帖文）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179459360855353133_6403053826af7534902c40.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179459360855353133_6403053826af7534902c40.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>演唱會打卡的限時動態已經被刪除。（圖片來源：譚嘉儀IG ）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/bigbang/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BIGBANG</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e5%98%89%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚嘉儀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e5%98%89%e9%9b%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃嘉雯</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3542920\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 14 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T10:43:44.118302+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1496,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T08:48:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:37:56.571965+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:37:13.338963+00:00","content_hash":"9643f562a4e774107a5a18f99ec88bf36ee6c5814ce13fb94a285861a6fffe1d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}